{"format":"sagebrush-space","version":1,"title":"A first space: notes, code and its output, and 3D plots","nodes":[{"id":"intro","kind":"note","title":"What is a space in 3D?","group":"notes","text":"# A space in 3D\n\nA terminal is **immutable 1D**, a notebook **mutable 1D**, a whiteboard **mutable 2D**, and a space in 3D **mutable 3D**.\n\n- Fly with the mouse: drag to turn, scroll to move, right-drag to pan.\n- Click anything to read it sharply; code and plots can be **edited and run** (Shift+Enter).\n- Search (top left) and click a result to fly there.\n\nThe objects here are described in plain JSON (`intro.space.json`), so an agent can write one.","position":[1.3,-5.01,9],"position2d":[12.95,1.65],"summary":"What a space in 3D is: a board in 3D, where notes, code with its output, and 3D plots are objects you fly between."},{"id":"format","kind":"note","title":"The format","group":"notes","text":"## foo.space.json\n\n```json\n{\"format\": \"sagebrush-space\", \"version\": 1,\n \"nodes\": [{\"id\": \"a\", \"kind\": \"note\", \"text\": \"# Hi\"}],\n \"edges\": [{\"from\": \"a\", \"to\": \"b\"}]}\n```\n\nKinds: `note` (Markdown), `code` (with `output`), `plot3d` (`surface` data), `file`. Positions are optional: the layout places what has none, in 3D, by its edges and its `group`.","position":[0.35,-8.7,18.54],"position2d":[22.85,2.51],"summary":"The file behind a space: objects, links and groups, with no coordinates needed; the layout is computed."},{"id":"logistic","kind":"code","title":"The logistic map's Lyapunov exponent","group":"code","lang":"python","text":"import numpy as np\nrs = np.linspace(2.5, 4.0, 1500)\nx = np.full_like(rs, 0.4)\nlyap = np.zeros_like(rs)\nfor i in range(700):\n    x = rs * x * (1 - x)\n    if i >= 500:\n        lyap += np.log(np.abs(rs * (1 - 2 * x)))\nlyap /= 200\nprint('chaos from r =', rs[np.argmax(lyap > 0)])","output":"chaos from r = 3.570713809206138","position":[5.24,1.09,-9.92],"position2d":[-6.96,-3.02],"summary":"Python with NumPy: where the logistic map $x \\mapsto r x (1 - x)$ turns chaotic, from its Lyapunov exponent over $r \\in [2.5, 4]$."},{"id":"zeta","kind":"code","title":"A sum, in Sage","group":"code","lang":"sage","text":"n = var('n')\nsum(1/n^2, n, 1, oo)","output":"1/6*pi^2","position":[13.29,4.42,-17.91],"position2d":[-12.86,-13.29],"summary":"Sage's symbolic sum: $\\sum_{n \\ge 1} 1/n^2 = \\pi^2/6$."},{"id":"sinc","kind":"plot3d","title":"z = sin(r)/r","group":"plots","lang":"sage","text":"x, y = var('x y')\nr = sqrt(x^2 + y^2)\nplot3d(sin(r) / r, (x, -10, 10), (y, -10, 10), plot_points=60)","surface":{"x":[-10,-9.5745,-9.1489,-8.7234,-8.2979,-7.8723,-7.4468,-7.0213,-6.5957,-6.1702,-5.7447,-5.3191,-4.8936,-4.4681,-4.0426,-3.617,-3.1915,-2.766,-2.3404,-1.9149,-1.4894,-1.0638,-0.6383,-0.2128,0.2128,0.6383,1.0638,1.4894,1.9149,2.3404,2.766,3.1915,3.617,4.0426,4.4681,4.8936,5.3191,5.7447,6.1702,6.5957,7.0213,7.4468,7.8723,8.2979,8.7234,9.1489,9.5745,10],"y":[-10,-9.5745,-9.1489,-8.7234,-8.2979,-7.8723,-7.4468,-7.0213,-6.5957,-6.1702,-5.7447,-5.3191,-4.8936,-4.4681,-4.0426,-3.617,-3.1915,-2.766,-2.3404,-1.9149,-1.4894,-1.0638,-0.6383,-0.2128,0.2128,0.6383,1.0638,1.4894,1.9149,2.3404,2.766,3.1915,3.617,4.0426,4.4681,4.8936,5.3191,5.7447,6.1702,6.5957,7.0213,7.4468,7.8723,8.2979,8.7234,9.1489,9.5745,10],"z":[[0.0707,0.0692,0.0616,0.0488,0.0319,0.0126,-0.0079,-0.0279,-0.0462,-0.062,-0.0745,-0.0835,-0.089,-0.0912,-0.0907,-0.088,-0.0837,-0.0784,-0.0729,-0.0674,-0.0626,-0.0587,-0.056,-0.0546,-0.0546,-0.056,-0.0587,-0.0626,-0.0674,-0.0729,-0.0784,-0.0837,-0.088,-0.0907,-0.0912,-0.089,-0.0835,-0.0745,-0.062,-0.0462,-0.0279,-0.0079,0.0126,0.0319,0.0488,0.0616,0.0692,0.0707],[0.0692,0.0611,0.0473,0.0291,0.0082,-0.0137,-0.0349,-0.0538,-0.0695,-0.081,-0.0883,-0.0912,-0.0903,-0.086,-0.0793,-0.0708,-0.0613,-0.0517,-0.0424,-0.0341,-0.027,-0.0215,-0.0177,-0.0158,-0.0158,-0.0177,-0.0215,-0.027,-0.0341,-0.0424,-0.0517,-0.0613,-0.0708,-0.0793,-0.086,-0.0903,-0.0912,-0.0883,-0.081,-0.0695,-0.053