"},{"from":"intro","to":"logistic"},{"from":"logistic","to":"zeta"},{"from":"logistic","to":"sinc"},{"from":"sinc","to":"saddle"},{"from":"why3d","to":"saddle"},{"from":"logistic","to":"figure"},{"from":"zeta","to":"matlab"}],"tours":[{"id":"first","title":"A first look","steps":[{"node":"intro","text":"Start here: a space in 3D is a board you can walk through. Everything you see is an object you can go to, read and run."},{"node":"logistic","text":"Code with its output. Press **Run** (or **Run all** in the panel) to run it in your browser on Sagebrush's engine."},{"node":"saddle","text":"A 3D plot is a real object: turn around it. Edit its Sage code and run it, and the object changes."},{"node":"why3d","text":"Why 3D at all: more room, and groups you can see from afar. Press **H** to see everything."}]}]}